<title>DENMARK: Danish Trygg-Baltica sells Australia unit.</title>
<headline>Danish Trygg-Baltica sells Australia unit.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish insurance group Trygg-Baltica A/S said on Monday that it had sold its wholly-owned Baltica Insurance Holdings (Australia) Ltd to Brisbane insurer Greatlands Pty Ltd which would continue to operate the company.</p>
<p>A Trygg-Baltica statement said that the ownership transfer, which included the Australian subsidiary Baltica General Insurance Company Ltd, would have no affect on the group result for 1996. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom</p>
</text>
